  18:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** /** \file
  19:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *  \brief Presentation layer for the D-Bus-2
  20:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     This module handles the predefined messages in the dbuspresentation.c + .h and
  21:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     includes definitions for software modules, as well as the forwarding mechanism
  22:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     of not-predefined-messages (e.g. nmt message handler), in the excess template: dbuspresentat
  23:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *
  24:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     An incoming message will be picked up by the presentation layer. If it is a predefined messa
  25:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     the presentation layer will handle this message. Else the message will be distributed to the
  26:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     message handler, which is defined in the excess template.
  27:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  *     
  28:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c ****  **************************************************************************************************
