 480:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** /**
 481:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** * Finds the memory module index corresponding to the memory module given by the overlaying layer.
 482:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** *
 483:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** * If the given memory module is not found, the index 0 is returned (hence the first defined module 
 484:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** * This function may be replaced by an empty function in the excess template to save ROM code - if t
 485:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** 
 486:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** \param ucMemoryModule
 487:common/prog/dbus/dbuspresentation.c **** The memory module, which index is sought.
