 163:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h **** /** \brief    Timer repetition and protection mode.
 164:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *
 165:common/prog/ped_fw/timer/system_timer.h ****  *  \details  This enumeration type is used configure repetition and protection
